?><main class="ji-page"><section class="ji-hero"><div class="ji-shell"><nav class="ji-crumb"><a href="index.php">Home</a> &nbsp;/&nbsp; <a href="tanzania-mid-range-safari">Mid-Range Safaris</a> &nbsp;/&nbsp; 5 Days</nav><span class="ji-kicker">Jarga Tours · Private Tanzania Safari</span><h1>5 Days Mid Range Tanzania Safari</h1><p>Explore four of Tanzania’s remarkable wildlife destinations, with private guiding and comfortable mid-range accommodation.</p></div></section><div class="ji-facts"><div class="ji-shell"><div class="ji-fact"><i class="far fa-calendar-alt"></i><span><b>5 Days</b><small>Safari duration</small></span></div><div class="ji-fact"><i class="fas fa-car-side"></i><span><b>Private Safari</b><small>Personalized journey</small></span></div><div class="ji-fact"><i class="fas fa-bed"></i><span><b>Mid-Range</b><small>Lodges & camps</small></span></div><div class="ji-fact"><i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt"></i><span><b>Northern Tanzania</b><small>Four destinations</small></span></div></div></div><div class="ji-shell ji-main"><div class="ji-content"><section class="ji-section" id="overview"><span class="ji-eyebrow">Your safari at a glance</span><h2>An unforgettable journey through Tanzania</h2><p class="ji-lead">This private five-day mid-range safari combines guided wildlife experiences with the comfort of selected lodges and camps. Visit Tarangire National Park, Lake Manyara National Park, the world-famous Serengeti and Ngorongoro Crater. Enjoy game drives with a professional local guide and the flexibility to discuss adjustments to your travel plans.</p><div class="ji-points"><div class="ji-point"><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>Private 4×4 safari vehicle</div><div class="ji-point"><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>Experienced English-speaking guide</div><div class="ji-point"><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>Mid-range lodges and safari camps</div><div class="ji-point"><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>Customizable travel arrangements</div></div></section><section class="ji-section" id="itinerary"><span class="ji-eyebrow">Day-by-day safari experience</span><h2>Your 5-Day Tanzania Safari Itinerary</h2><p class="ji-lead">Follow the journey from the baobab landscapes of Tarangire to the Serengeti plains and Ngorongoro Crater.</p><article class="ji-day"><div class="ji-number">01</div><div class="ji-daybody"><div class="ji-dayhead"><small>Day 1 · Arusha / Moshi → Tarangire → Lodge</small><h3>Tarangire National Park</h3></div><div class="ji-daycontent"><p>Travel from your hotel to Tarangire National Park, celebrated for its ancient baobab trees and large elephant herds. Enjoy a guided game drive along the Tarangire River, where wildlife gathers throughout the year. Continue to your comfortable mid-range lodge or camp after the safari.</p><div class="ji-tags"><span><i class="fas fa-binoculars"></i> Game drive</span><span><i class="fas fa-utensils"></i> Lunch &amp; dinner</span></div></div></div></article><article class="ji-day"><div class="ji-number">02</div><div class="ji-daybody"><div class="ji-dayhead"><small>Day 2 · Lodge → Lake Manyara → Karatu</small><h3>Lake Manyara National Park</h3></div><div class="ji-daycontent"><p>Explore Lake Manyara National Park, where groundwater forests meet open landscapes and the lake attracts diverse birdlife. Look for elephants, hippos, zebras and, with luck, the park’s tree-climbing lions. Return to your lodge in Karatu.</p><div class="ji-tags"><span><i class="fas fa-binoculars"></i> Wildlife &amp; birdwatching</span><span><i class="fas fa-utensils"></i> Confirm with your consultant</span></div></div></div></article><article class="ji-day"><div class="ji-number">03</div><div class="ji-daybody"><div class="ji-dayhead"><small>Day 3 · Karatu → Serengeti</small><h3>Journey to Serengeti National Park</h3></div><div class="ji-daycontent"><p>Travel toward the legendary Serengeti and enjoy game viewing en route. The plains support lions, elephants, buffalo, giraffes and many other species. Depending on season and wildlife movements, you may encounter migrating herds. Overnight at a mid-range Serengeti camp or lodge.</p><div class="ji-tags"><span><i class="fas fa-binoculars"></i> Scenic drive &amp; game drive</span><span><i class="fas fa-utensils"></i> Lunch &amp; dinner</span></div></div></div></article><article class="ji-day"><div class="ji-number">04</div><div class="ji-daybody"><div class="ji-dayhead"><small>Day 4 · Serengeti National Park</small><h3>Full-Day Serengeti Safari</h3></div><div class="ji-daycontent"><p>Spend the day exploring the Serengeti’s diverse habitats with morning and afternoon game drives. Your guide will seek out wildlife activity, from big cats to grazing antelope and hippo pools. Return to your camp or lodge in the evening.</p><div class="ji-tags"><span><i class="fas fa-binoculars"></i> Full-day game drives</span><span><i class="fas fa-utensils"></i> Full board</span></div></div></div></article><article class="ji-day"><div class="ji-number">05</div><div class="ji-daybody"><div class="ji-dayhead"><small>Day 5 · Serengeti → Ngorongoro Crater → Arusha / Moshi</small><h3>Ngorongoro Crater &amp; Return</h3></div><div class="ji-daycontent"><p>Depart early for the Ngorongoro Conservation Area. Descend to the crater floor for a game drive in this extraordinary natural setting, home to a remarkable concentration of wildlife. After your visit, continue to Arusha or Moshi for the end of the safari.</p><div class="ji-tags"><span><i class="fas fa-binoculars"></i> Crater game drive &amp; transfer</span><span><i class="fas fa-utensils"></i> Confirm with your consultant</span></div></div></div></article></section><section class="ji-section" id="inclusions"><span class="ji-eyebrow">Everything you need to know</span><h2>What’s Included & Excluded</h2><div class="ji-inex"><div class="ji-panel"><h3>Safari Includes</h3><ul><li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i><span>Kilimanjaro International Airport pick-up and drop-off as arranged</span></li><li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i><span>Private 4×4 Toyota Land Cruiser with pop-up roof</span></li><li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i><span>Professional English-speaking safari guide</span></li><li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i><span>National park fees as stated in your confirmed itinerary</span></li><li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i><span>Safari accommodation at agreed lodges or camps</span></li><li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i><span>Safari meals according to your confirmed program</span></li><li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i><span>Bottled drinking water during the tour</span></li><li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i><span>First-aid kit and binoculars</span></li><li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i><span>Activities specifically mentioned in the confirmed itinerary</span></li></ul></div><div class="ji-panel ji-ex"><h3>Safari Excludes</h3><ul><li><i class="fas fa-minus-circle"></i><span>International flights</span></li><li><i class="fas fa-minus-circle"></i><span>Visa fees and travel insurance</span></li><li><i class="fas fa-minus-circle"></i><span>Personal purchases and souvenirs</span></li><li><i class="fas fa-minus-circle"></i><span>Alcoholic beverages and soft drinks</span></li><li><i class="fas fa-minus-circle"></i><span>Optional activities not listed in the itinerary</span></li><li><i class="fas fa-minus-circle"></i><span>Tips and gratuities for the guide</span></li></ul></div></div><p class="ji-note">Accommodation names, exact meal arrangements and any seasonal itinerary adjustments are confirmed in your individual quotation.</p></section></div><aside class="ji-side" id="booking"><div class="ji-book"><div class="ji-booktop"><small>Plan your adventure</small><h2>Enquire About This Safari</h2><p>Share your travel details and our team will prepare a personalized quotation.</p></div><form class="ji-form" action="booking-submit.php" method="post"><input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="<?php echo htmlspecialchars($_SESSION[